          "method_draft": "First read the diagram: MNPR is a parallelogram with diagonals MP and RN intersecting at Q. The angle marked 83° at Q is the angle on the right side between rays QN and QP, i.e. ∠NQP. The requested angle ∠MQN is the angle at Q between QM and QN, immediately adjacent to ∠NQP. Since QM and QP are opposite rays on the same straight diagonal MP, ∠MQN and ∠NQP form a linear pair. Therefore m∠MQN = 180° − 83° = 97°.",
